From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: send blocking CMD_DOWNLOAD_CONFIG 0x30 after 0x1b

since21 skipped 0x30 when REPORT_STATUS 10 00 had need_*=0, then sent
CMD_RESET 0x04 and identify. Both timed out with gpio staying 1 — the IC
is in HDL-v2 waiting for CMD_DOWNLOAD_CONFIG, not RESET/IDENTIFY.

since22:
- After 0x1b with need_*=0 and 0x30 not yet sent this boot, send 0x30
  from probe (process context, blocking write_message, IRQ enabled).
  Payload is stock APP_CONFIG from td4150_a12s_boe.bin (hdlv=2,
  HDL_TOUCH_CONFIG). Log if bits were 0. Never wait=0 from IRQ.
- Do not CMD_RESET or extra identify before 0x30.
- After a successful 0x30, run stock HDL-complete helper (identify +
  touch_reinit). If 0x30 times out, log cmd/status/attn/gpio/irq and
  skip RESET/identify.
- Keep in_hdl_mode=0, no ENABLE_REPORT 0x05, no do_polling, no SPI
  read when ATTN idle, no resume reinit after identify timeout.

Applies after syna-tcm-hdl-complete-reinit.patch.

